    rdfs:label "Protein P60763" ;
    core:proteinSubcellularLocationText "Cytoplasm {ECO:0000269|PubMed:15107133}. Endomembrane system. Cell projection, lamellipodium. Cytoplasm, perinuclear region. Cell membrane. Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton. Note=Membrane-associated when activated. Localizes to actin-based membrane ruffles (PubMed:15107133). Colocalizes with NRBP to endomembranes and at the cell periphery in lamellipodia. Colocalized with CIB1 in the perinuclear area and at the cell periphery. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:15107133}." .

